{"version":1,"content":"<p>本屆金鐘獎前晚圓滿落幕，評審事後公布得獎票數。</p><p>女演員瑞瑪席丹大比數拋離對手李心潔，成為迷你劇視后，她坦言一度想過退出演藝圈。</p><p>戲劇節目出爐視帝及視后莊凱勛及楊貴媚，同樣以一票之差險勝，前者慨嘆被AI搶飯碗。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T16:21:50.399339+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T16:01:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T16:18:22.983942+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T16:18:22.983942+00:00","content_hash":"d5944622da0a1a68327148e287bfdbcb71396256309ee99dc8d146399d9400f4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}